# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# What belongs in this repository, and what does not.
#
#   repository (git)   code · prompts · README · LICENSE · requirements · reported numbers
#   Release v1.0.0     the fixed Books artifacts (queries.parquet / cards.jsonl /
#                      split_manifest.json / leak_dropped_uids.json / processed/)
#   not distributed    the raw corpus (a download script is provided) and regenerable
#                      large intermediates
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# ---- Python ----
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*.egg-info/
.venv/
venv/
.ipynb_checkpoints/

# ---- raw corpus ----
# Amazon Reviews 2023 is public and is not redistributed here:
#   python src/download_data.py --category Books
data/raw/*
!data/raw/.gitkeep

# ---- fixed artifacts: published as Release v1.0.0 assets ----
# Kept out of git for size, not by policy (queries.parquet alone exceeds GitHub's 100 MB
# per-file limit). Fetch them with scripts/fetch_release_assets.sh.
data/preprocessed/*/queries.parquet
data/preprocessed/*/cards.jsonl
data/preprocessed/*/split_manifest.json
data/preprocessed/*/processed/
data/preprocessed/*/leak_dropped_uids.json
!data/preprocessed/books/leak_dropped_uids.json

# ---- large, regenerable ----
# embeddings/ is rebuilt deterministically from processed/ + cards.jsonl by stage [6].
data/preprocessed/*/embeddings/
data/preprocessed/*/interactions.pkl
data/preprocessed/*/interactions_raw.pkl
data/preprocessed/*/sample.parquet
data/preprocessed/_cache/
data/preprocessed/*/cards_legacy_v1.jsonl

# ---- run outputs ----
runs/
release_assets/

# results/ holds two kinds of files. The pipeline statistics written by stages [2] and [4]
# are regenerable and stay out; the reported numbers (paper_results.json and the per-seed
# files) are a few kilobytes and are tracked so a reproduction can be compared against them.
results/*
!results/README.md
!results/paper_results.json
!results/books/
results/books/*
!results/books/seed_*.json

# ---- working archives ----
*.zip

# ---- OS / editors ----
.DS_Store
*.swp
.idea/
.vscode/
